ADDITIONAL NOTICE FOR THIS PROJECT

PHOTOSENSITIVITY WARNING. This Software displays flashing lights, strobing and
rapidly moving high-contrast patterns generated in real time. It may trigger
seizures in people with photosensitive epilepsy, even in those with no prior
history of seizures. If you, or anyone in your household, has an epileptic
condition, consult a physician before use. Stop use immediately and consult a
physician if you experience any of the following while or shortly after using
the Software: altered vision, eye or muscle twitching, involuntary movements,
loss of awareness, disorientation, or convulsions. The Software includes an
in-app notice and settings ("Echo trails", "Stereo") that reduce motion and
visual intensity, but they do not eliminate this risk.

This Software is sample and demonstration code, provided for entertainment and
educational purposes only. It is not a certified or reviewed product. Use is
entirely at your own risk.

This Software bundles four third-party music tracks under `app/src/main/assets/music/`,
each licensed separately under Creative Commons Attribution (CC BY 3.0 or 4.0) by
their respective authors — see `app/src/main/assets/music/ATTRIBUTION.md` and the
README for full attribution. Those tracks are NOT covered by the MIT grant above;
they remain under their original CC BY licenses and require attribution if reused.
